  "permissionNotGrantedLater": "Uruhushya ntirwatanzwe. Ushobora gufungura gukurikirana ubwabyo nyuma mu Igenamiterere.",
  "trackAutomatically": "Kurikirana amafaranga ubwabyo",
  "trackAutomaticallyBody": "Iki ni cyo gituma FinWise itandukana n'izindi. Isoma SMS za Mobile Money ikandika buri bwishyu n'ayinjiye — nta kwandika n'intoki.",
  "featInstant": "Ako kanya",
